Z||000000||Homicidal||11-08-2001||01:21 AM||||I gotta do it, my car damn near swerves off the road if I hit a rather large bump. <P>But that's a lot to pour into my car right now.  But from what I hear, I'll see a huge improvement!  Anybody got any words of encouragement/discouragement before I haul my baby to Sears?||||reg||1
Z||000001||BlackStang95||11-08-2001||01:29 AM||||Thats what I paid for new shocks on my baby too.  Almost to the dollar.  I didn't notice a huge difference, less dip during accel and braking...you gotta do what you gotta do.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fierowrecker||11-08-2001||02:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Homicidal:<BR><B>I gotta do it, my car damn near swerves off the road if I hit a rather large bump. <P>But that's a lot to pour into my car right now.  But from what I hear, I'll see a huge improvement!  Anybody got any words of encouragement/discouragement before I haul my baby to Sears?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Take it to a suspention shop FIRST!<BR>You may have worn ball joints, bushings, rod ends, and bearings...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
Z||000003||Homicidal||11-08-2001||03:06 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierowrecker:<BR><B> Take it to a suspention shop FIRST!<BR>You may have worn ball joints, bushings, rod ends, and bearings...<BR>crash...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, they did a whole inspection first of course, and that's what they said the problem was.  They specialize in suspension at the one I took it to.  That's how I know it's shocks + struts.  It has to be, they are the original stocks and the car is well over 120,000 miles.  Even if that's not the problem, can't hurt I guess.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Homicidal||11-08-2001||03:07 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Thats what I paid for new shocks on my baby too.  Almost to the dollar.  I didn't notice a huge difference, less dip during accel and braking...you gotta do what you gotta do.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, I should, considering they are damn near non-existant at this point.  I swear, I can feel every single little bump I hit, no matter how minor.||||reg||1
